'a': hot, father, call, dark, far, pall, Iran (la.iran., not "I ran")....
"=E6": pat, math, pal, cap, ran....
"A": mate, pail, ray, date....
In Lojban, the first and last are zo.a and lu .ai li'u, respectively. The b=
est way to render =E6 in Lojban I can think of is lu .ae li'u, but that's n=
ot a legal diphthong.
